    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 13:34:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：暴躁洲哥，大猴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：汉堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们“哈乱斗”了温哥华这座城，聊了对这个城市的初印象，包括了文化，歧视和美食，同时我们也收集了发生在自己周边的“诡事”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其中8分半左右的小说是<death by="" landscape=""> by Margaret Atwood</death></span></p><span></span><p><span>Atwood是加拿大相当知名的小说家。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">6:24</a> 文化差异，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 美国VS加拿大 "≈" 上海VS苏州？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 海外华人面临的一些敌意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 加拿大的娱乐明星：比伯和签签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 温哥华美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 温村“诡”事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">61:13</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>playlist:</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头 :<baby> Justin Bieber</baby></span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: &lt;一点&gt; 暴躁洲哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：<here we="" go=""> 暴躁洲哥 new Zealand</here></span></p>]]></description>
