  <item>
    <title>005:一切都从姚明的辞职说起。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672ef7da43dc3a438732c272</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672ef7da43dc3a438732c272</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Nov 2024 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>姚明辞职了，引的我们唏嘘不已，当然唏嘘归唏嘘，该认可要认可，该批评还是得批评，希望中国篮球的商业化可以越走越好，我们也对商业化的现状和根本目的发表了自己的观点。贼不走空，我们顺便各立山头聊了聊NBA的辣几个男人。节目精彩，大家快来听吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a>对中国男篮和CBA发展的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a>中国篮球是改革不是变革</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a>体育人才的培养与体教结合的现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a>NBA的辣几个男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a>他的决定1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2459">40:59</a>遇事不决，原生家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：直到世界终结 ；所属专辑《世界が終るまでは…》；歌曲原唱：</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/WANDS/2185457?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/WANDS/2185457?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>WANDS</span></a></p>]]></description>
